Test fixtures (tests/fixtures/*.tsv) are the recorded output of MPU 0.75,
produced by the scripts in tools/fixtures/. They are used to check that this
port gives the same answers as MPU. Where MPU's answer is mathematically wrong,
the test asserts the correct value and skips the row with a named comment; such
differences and review limits are listed in
[docs/upstream-findings.md](docs/upstream-findings.md).

